The CSS layout expects the item text (`span`) and price tag (`sspan`) to be grouped inside a single container on the left, with the delete button completely on the right. 

If you just slap them all loosely into `newList`, your elements will look jumbled on screen! Take another peek at the layout structure comment inside the HTML `<ul>` to see how those children should be nested.“G
