To surgically remove one specific item from an array list, JavaScript gives you a specialized tool called **`.splice()`**.

```javascript
let basket = ["Apple", "Banana", "Orange"];

// Splice needs two pieces of info: (Where to start, How many items to delete)
basket.splice(1, 1); 

// The array train instantly updates to: ["Apple", "Orange"]
```



