### üß∞ Your Current Developer Toolbox
You aren't a beginner guessing at code anymore. Look at what you actually know how to do:
1. **DOM Manipulation:** Grabbing inputs and injecting elements (`document.createElement`).
2. **State Arrays:** Storing lists of items in background memory (`.push()`, `.splice()`).
