DOM manipulation is just using Javascript Objects to control HTML. 
* Selecting an element (`document.querySelector`) gives you an **Object**.
* Elements with the same class (`document.querySelectorAll`) give you a **List (Array-like NodeList)**.



Because these are just Objects and Arrays, you can use your exact Step 1 and Step 2 skills to control them!

