}const multiply = (a, b) => a * b; // One-line wizardry! how am i suppoesed to use it and print the output or pass the values ıIt feels like absolute magic the first time you see it, right? Because there are no curly braces or explicit `return` words, it can look a bit confusing to read or execute.

