### ü™ì Level 1 DOM Specifications

Write your solutions using arrow functions inside that empty `<script>` tag. 

#### üõí 1. The Checkout Discount Engine
* **Goal:** Target `#price-input`, `#tier-select`, `#checkout-btn`, and `#total-output`.
