## üîç The Structural Difference in 2 Sentences

* **The Web Development Route:** Uses JavaScript logic to manipulate the **Browser Environment** (the DOM, buttons, animations, visual layouts).
* **The Software/Backend Route:** Uses JavaScript logic to manipulate the **Machine Environment** (files on a hard drive, server network ports, databases, raw cloud data storage).

