### üöÄ What the "Next Level" Actually Is

Leveling up doesn't mean writing loops forever. The next evolutionary step in your training is **Interactivity**. 

Right now, your code runs automatically when the page loads. In a real software application, code runs when a human being **interacts** with the screen (e.g., clicking a button, typing in a form, submitting a checkout cart). 

To do this, we need to add **Event Listeners** to our pipeline.

