* **Extra Thing 2 (Data-Driven UI):** Inside the click listener, subtract $1$ from the actual data property (`driver.passengerLimit`). Then, update the screen text content by directly reading that object property (`element.textContent = driver.passengerLimit`) rather than hardcoding a string.
