You have only one minor logical flaw inside your event listener that contradicts the prompt's condition rules:

```javascript
// What happens when clicking:
if (streamSong.activeListeners === 0) {
    // ...
} else {
    songCard.classList.add("no-listeners") // üö® This adds the class even if there ARE listeners!
}
