3. **The Filtering Engine:** Inside that input listener:
   * Grab the current text the user typed using `event.target.value` (or `inputElement.value`). Convert it to lowercase using `.toLowerCase()` so the search isn't case-sensitive.
   * Use the JavaScript `.filter()` array method on `companyEmployees` to create a new array containing *only* the employees whose names include the searched text (hint: `employee.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)`).
