2. **Form Submission & Data Creation (State Addition):** Capturing text fields from a form submission event, preventing the page from reloading (`e.preventDefault()`), turning that text into a *brand new object*, pushing it into your data array, and rendering it (e.g., adding a new todo item, posting a comment).

