         priority: priorityInput.value
     };
     ```
   * Use `.push()` to append this fresh `newTask` object directly into your global `projectTasks` array.
5. **The Reset & Repaint:** Clear the input fields so they are ready for the next entry (hint: `taskForm.reset()`), and call your rendering function with the updated array!

